# 404s, same reason to capture it from a live checkout with
# `git diff > container/bin/patches/disable-prewarming.patch` rather than
# reinvent it from a name).
#
# What it has to do: WebKit prewarms a web process ahead of the navigation
# that will use it (WebProcessPool's prewarming path,
# didReachGoodTimeToPrewarm in WebPageProxy.cpp is the trigger
# claude/skills' own notes on process attach already name -- see cmd/gui's
# 'web process' case). A memory-usage run wants exactly one process doing
# exactly one thing, and a prewarmed spare confuses both the process count
# and the memory total, so the experiment disables it -- most likely a
# WebPreferences/WebsitePolicies toggle or a build-time flag, whichever the
# checkout that still has this patch actually uses.
#
# Until this is a real diff, applying it is refused rather than silently
# skipped: `git apply container/bin/patches/disable-prewarming.patch` fails
